    "id": "character-of-god",
    "q": "What is God’s character according to the relational gospel and the Jesus lens?",
    "short": "God is exactly like Jesus: self-giving love, light without darkness, faithful, humble, patient, kind and never coercive. His justice heals and his holiness is his utterly other, utterly pure love. Where our picture of God does not look like Jesus, the picture needs correcting, not Jesus.",
